<h1>Invocation Order</h1>
</div>
<div id="content">
<div class="paragraph">
<p>This section explains the order of method invocations on a syntax highlighter.
For a concrete example we use this document:</p>
</div>
<div class="listingblock">
<div class="content">
<pre class="highlight"><code class="language-asciidoc" data-lang="asciidoc">Unresolved directive in invocation-order.adoc - include::example$syntax-highlighting-order.adoc[]</code></pre>
</div>
</div>
<div class="paragraph">
<p>For this document the calls to a syntax highlighter will happen in this order:</p>
